## Duplicate recovery source

- `research/target-c-prestress-mainline-2026-08-31` contains the same four low-diameter/prestress reports copied from `research/target-c-low-diameter-prestress-2026-08-31`; it has no additional branch-only report to preserve.

## Deletion state

After the consolidation commit, every one of the 99 non-main branch refs is semantically safe to delete: unique material is copied, duplicate material is already on `main`, and obsolete material is recorded here with its supersession status.

The GitHub connector used for this audit exposes branch creation and ref updates but does not expose a delete-branch / delete-ref mutation. Therefore this audit does **not** claim that the refs themselves were deleted. Actual ref deletion remains a mechanical cleanup step after this commit.
